<title>FRANCE: France to offer 21-23 bln Ffr BTANS on Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 21-23 bln Ffr BTANS on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said it would offer 21 to 23 billion francs of BTANS at its auction on Thursday, June 19.</p>
<p>On offer will be the 4.75 percent April 1999 BTAN and the 4.75 percent March 2002 BTAN. Payment for the April 1999 issue is due July 7, 1997 while payment for the March 2002 line is due July 15, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 54 52</p>
